Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-223: ZepModernM2 - modern MD21/v272-274 models in
 the 3.3.5 model runtime

Port of WarcraftXL wxl-modern-m2's downport + v1.1 skin contract rebuild onto the
decomp's read seams: container demux, TXID names via Zeppelin\FileDataPaths.txt,
camera/particle compaction, sequence/material fixes, skin batch rebuild, AFM2 unwrap,
shadow-animate gate. Verified: retail Shadowlands boar2 (v274) renders and animates.

